ic 'despised' every moment of US Open defeat</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:751d5d248bca7ea1af50b9dc4a71924f11067314e1894544ed7bffee2f455e9e</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:26:20Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T09:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ailing-djokovic-despised-every-moment-of-us-open-defeat/a-78572187--b4b8aa9b6f7a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ailing-djokovic-despised-every-moment-of-us-open-defeat/a-78572187?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Novak Djokovic has exited in the first round of a Grand Slam for the first time in over two decades. Could time — or an unknown health condition — be catching up with the Serbian tennis legend?</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Remembering Dolly Parton: 8 facts about the icon</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e805d3cb8c34e3a90d1a4e965a1cafc586e110866bdddfa155c5cf14065874bf</id><updated>2026-09-02T19:26:20Z</updated><published>2026-08-25T18:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/remembering-dolly-parton-8-facts-about-the-icon/a-75503168--7aa2734c090f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/remembering-dolly-parton-8-facts-about-the-icon/a-75503168?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Dolly Parton, one of the world's most successful artists, has died at the age of 80. Here are some important and extraordinary facts about the country music superstar.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry></feed>
